TITLE Scenario 723: pH=6.5, Metals=High, EDTA=10mg/L, Loam, Mesic
SOLUTION 1  Multi-metal contaminated soil
    temp      25
    pH        6.5
    pe        8
    units     mol/L
    Pb        1.4479e-03  # 300 mg/L
    Cu        3.9339e-03  # 250 mg/L
    Zn        6.1181e-03  # 400 mg/L
    Ca        1.25e-3
    Mg        8.23e-4
    Na        4.35e-3
    Cl        4.23e-3
    C(4)      1.0e-3
    Edta      3.4218e-05  # 10 mg/L
    
SURFACE 1  Soil surface sites
    Hfo_wOH   0.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
